@startuml
title PasswordValidator - test generation and revision

actor "C# developer" as Developer
boundary "Rider integration" as Rider
control "Test generation pipeline" as Pipeline
participant "RAG retrieval" as RAG
participant "GenAI model" as Model
participant ".NET test execution" as Runner

Developer -> Rider : Select PasswordValidator
Rider -> Pipeline : Submit C# code and xUnit settings (X)
Pipeline -> Pipeline : Extract source code context
Pipeline -> RAG : Request relevant code and test examples
RAG --> Pipeline : Return relevant examples

loop While attempts remain and no candidate is validated
  Pipeline -> Model : Send context, examples, and available feedback
  Model --> Pipeline : Return generated or revised C# tests
  Pipeline -> Runner : Build the test project
  Runner --> Pipeline : Return build status and diagnostics
  opt Build succeeds
    Pipeline -> Runner : Run tests and measure coverage
    Runner --> Pipeline : Return test results and coverage
  end
  alt Tests pass and meet the coverage target
    Pipeline -> Pipeline : Mark tests as validated
  else Build, tests, or coverage criteria fail
    Pipeline -> Pipeline : Prepare feedback for the next attempt
  end
end

Pipeline --> Rider : Return latest C# tests (y) and validation status
Rider --> Developer : Show tests and validation report
@enduml
